rows.en:
Don't get mad, I'm not insulting you.
Hino said you're a cute kid he just can't leave alone.
No idea if that's true, though.{p}

Well, that was only at first.
My buddy's dead.
Now I can say flat out that that's how it is.{p}

...The movie tickets I'd bought for my buddy went to waste.
Thinking about that, one day after school I wandered over and looked into the classroom where his class had been.
It was pretty late, so the room was empty.{p}

She pressed her hands together toward the grave and stayed still for a while.
Her soft-looking hair slid smoothly over her shoulder.
For a second there, I thought I'd like to touch it.{p}

Still, when he called me from the hospital, he really sounded fine.
You never know what's coming, huh?
I pressed my hands together at my buddy's grave too.{p}
